flowchart TB
  User[Desktop operator] --> UI[PySide6 window and thread pool]
  Browser[Local browser] --> Web[FastAPI and Uvicorn thread]
  UI --> Context[AppContext and session factory]
  Web --> Context
  Context --> DB[(SQLite catalog)]
  UI --> Pipeline[Download pipeline]
  Pipeline --> Source[yt-dlp and source metadata]
  Pipeline --> Audio[FFmpeg / Mutagen / librosa]
  Pipeline --> Primary[Primary audio library]
  Primary --> Copies[Verified extra library copies]
